<title>NEW ZEALAND: Natural Gas to exit appliance retailing.</title>
<headline>Natural Gas to exit appliance retailing.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's Natural Gas Corporation said on Monday it had decided to withdraw progressively from appliance retailing, maintaining customer service through a newly-established centralised call centre in Hamilton.</p>
<p>Six gas centre retail outlets, in Whangarei, Tauranga, Rotorua, Taupo, Gisborne and Hamilton will close over the next four months, with the loss of 32 positions.</p>
